Package: libwayland0
Version: @DEB_WAYLAND_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: libffi8, libepoll-shim0
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://wayland.freedesktop.org
Description: Wayland client, server, cursor and EGL libraries
 Wayland is a protocol for a compositor to talk to its clients. This package
 contains the runtime libraries (libwayland-client, libwayland-server,
 libwayland-cursor and libwayland-egl), built for Darwin/iOS using epoll-shim
 for the event loop.
